Wolfram Research has curated a large amount of data.
Used by Apple\[CloseCurlyQuote]s Siri and Wolfram Alpha.  \
\>", "Subtitle",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.832750497120799*^9, 3.8327505008152533`*^9}, {
